## **FAQs**

What is sales presentation software?

Sales presentation software helps reps build and deliver presentations that support their
pitch—whether it’s a product demo, solution overview, or follow-up. It saves time, keeps things
on-brand, and helps you tell a clearer story that lands with your audience.

How is online sales presentation software different from traditional tools?

Traditional tools require building presentations from scratch, managing brand assets manually, and
switching between design, content, and approval steps. Online platforms like Prezent do the heavy
lifting—offering AI-powered slide creation, brand-locked templates, and instant access to reusable
content. You save time, reduce errors, and deliver more tailored, consistent presentations every
time.

What sets Prezent apart from other sales presentation platforms?

Prezent stands out by combining enterprise-grade AI with structured storytelling and brand-safe
design—so you can create high-impact sales decks in minutes. With 35,000+ customizable slides,
10,000+ best-practice examples, and Communication Fingerprints to personalize by audience, it brings
everything sales teams need into one powerful, easy-to-use platform.

How long does it take to create a sales presentation using Prezent?

What used to take hours or even weeks can now be done in just a few minutes. Prezent’s AI quickly
generates structured, branded presentations based on your input. You can also choose from ready-made
sales templates, browse best-practice examples for inspiration, or use the Overnight Presentations
service to receive a polished deck the next morning. It’s a faster, easier way to stay ahead without
compromising on quality.

Are there ready-to-use templates designed for sales meetings and demos?

Yes. Prezent offers a wide range of templates designed specifically for sales use cases—from
discovery calls to final proposals. These templates are fully customizable and always in line with
your brand guidelines, so you look sharp every time.

