## **FAQs**

How can Prezent help the Chief of Staff streamline executive communication?

Prezent streamlines executive communication by leveraging enterprise-grade AI to transform complex
information into concise, leadership-ready presentations. The Synthesis feature automatically
generates one-page executive summaries from detailed decks, ensuring clarity and alignment with
executive expectations. Additionally, Communication Fingerprints tailor presentations to match
individual executive preferences, enhancing engagement and effectiveness.

Can I use Prezent to prepare board decks, leadership updates, and internal reports?

Yes. Prezent is purpose-built for high-stakes communication. With over 35,000 brand-compliant slides
and 10,000+ best-practice examples, you can build polished board decks and internal updates in
minutes. Its enterprise-grade AI and Story Builder feature ensure your message is structured,
strategic, and aligned with leadership expectations.

How does Prezent ensure presentations align with brand and executive expectations?

Prezent ensures brand alignment through its Template Converter, which automatically adapts slides to
your company's brand guidelines, maintaining consistency in fonts, colors, and layouts. The
Communication Fingerprint feature further personalizes content to align with individual executive
communication styles, ensuring presentations meet both brand and audience expectations.

Can multiple teams contribute to a single presentation without losing consistency?

Yes. Prezent’s Presentation Library acts as a central hub where teams can upload, manage, and share
decks. With detailed access controls and commenting features, multiple contributors can collaborate
while maintaining consistency. Everyone works from the same version, using brand-approved
templates—so nothing goes off-track.

How much time can a Chief of Staff save using Prezent for recurring presentations?

Prezent can reduce presentation creation time from days to minutes by automating structure,
formatting, and branding. With features like auto-generated executive summaries and reusable content
libraries, Chiefs of Staff save hours on every recurring update or cross-functional deck.

