How can Prezent support medical affairs teams in creating compliant presentations

Prezent offers structured, brand-approved templates that help medical affairs teams stay compliant
while building presentations. By removing the need for manual formatting and enforcing consistency
in slide layouts, the platform supports accurate, aligned, and efficient communication across
