## **FAQs**

How is Prezent the best AI presentation software for Data & Analytics teams?

Prezent is built to help data and analytics teams turn complex models, dashboards, and datasets into
clear, compelling, and on-brand presentations. Its AI translates raw data and reports into
audience-ready visuals, automatically applying your organization’s brand and structure. With
expert-curated templates, proven story frameworks, and personalization at scale, Prezent enables
analytics teams to communicate insights with clarity, speed, and consistency.

How quickly can teams create data-heavy presentations in Prezent?

Teams can generate polished, insight-rich presentations in minutes rather than days. Prezent’s AI
automates layout, slide creation, and visual selection, making it easy to respond quickly to
business needs without compromising quality or compliance. Many customers experience a 70–90%
reduction in presentation creation time.

Can Prezent visualize my data directly?

Yes. Prezent analyzes numerical, tabular, and unstructured data and automatically selects the most
effective charts, graphs, and scientific visuals to highlight key trends and insights. Through the
Auto Generation API, your internal tools can send data directly to Prezent for instant conversion
into on-brand slides, turning dashboards, models, and real-time metrics into clear, compelling
presentations without requiring manual formatting.

Can I reuse or repurpose existing analytics presentations in Prezent?

Absolutely. Prezent imports your existing decks and converts them into updated, brand-consistent
presentations within minutes. You can blend legacy slides with new AI-generated content, refresh
outdated visuals, and personalize each deck for specific audiences—all while maintaining design
quality and consistency.

How does Prezent’s AI understand the context behind our analytics reports and models to create
relevant presentations?

Prezent, powered by its AI engine Astrid and Specialized Presentation Models (SPMs), is trained on
millions of industry-specific slides and communication patterns used in BioPharma analytics. It
understands the terminology, structures, and narrative styles common in scientific and data-driven
communication. It analyzes inputs, reports, and materials to spot key themes, build logical flow,
and adjust depth and tone for your audience.

