## **FAQs**

How is Prezent the best AI presentation software for communication teams?

Prezent combines enterprise-grade AI, intelligent agents, and deep integration capabilities to
streamline every part of presentation creation and communication management. Its unique
Communication Fingerprint engine understands context, audience, and brand, while API support allows
organizations to connect Prezent to their preferred tools and automate workflow even further, making
it the most flexible, efficient platform for communication leaders needing speed, scale, and
governance.

How does Prezent help communication teams create leadership messages and announcements faster?

With Prezent, leadership updates and announcements can be drafted, designed, and formatted in
minutes thanks to its auto-generator, story builder, and AI-based editing. Simply provide a prompt
or upload a doc, and Prezent instantly suggests professional layouts, consistent style, and key
narrative flows—slashing creation time by about 90% compared to manual methods, perfect for urgent
communications or crisis messaging.

Does Prezent offer ready-made templates for town halls, team meetings, and leadership communication?

Yes, Prezent provides access to over 35,000 purpose-built templates, including those for town halls,
team meetings, leadership updates, analyst briefings, and more. These templates are professionally
designed, fully customizable, and can be updated to follow any brand’s guidelines, ensuring
relevance for internal and external presentations.

Does Prezent offer communication training or learning programs?

Absolutely. Communication teams get access to on-demand learning modules and best-practice libraries
curated by experts, covering skills like business storytelling, problem solving, and effective
message delivery. Prezent also offers interactive workshops and one-on-one feedback, enabling teams
to sharpen communication and presentation skills affordably and efficiently.

How does Prezent help communication teams uphold brand and message governance in presentations?

Prezent automatically applies brand styles—logos, colors, fonts—and enforces story frameworks, so
every deck remains visually and contextually aligned with company standards. Built-in compliance
features and team-wide brand templates ensure that every message sent out is clear, consistent, and
matches required guidelines, whether for internal leaders or external stakeholders.

