Prezent offers a Slide Library with 35,000+ ready-to-use slides, best-practice examples, and AI
tools that help structure your content into clear, branded training presentations. You can also use
expert overnight services to polish decks when you're short on time.

Are there templates available for onboarding, skill-building, and internal workshops?

Yes. Prezent includes templates specifically designed for onboarding, internal workshops, and
training sessions. These templates follow standard communication formats and can be customized to
fit your content and audience.

Can I customize learning content to match different audience needs or roles?

Yes. Prezent’s Communication Fingerprint adjusts the tone, structure, and flow of your presentation
based on the preferences of your target audience—so the same training can be adapted for new hires,
senior leaders, or cross-functional teams. Create your Communication Fingerprint

Does Prezent ensure all training materials follow brand and design guidelines?

Yes. Every presentation built in Prezent automatically applies your brand’s fonts, colors, logos,
and layouts. Locked formatting ensures all training materials stay consistent, regardless of who
builds them.

Can I convert existing training presentations to match our brand guidelines using Prezent?

Yes. The Transform feature lets you upload existing decks and instantly reformat them using your
company’s templates. Prezent fixes fonts, colors, spacing, and logos to make them fully
brand-compliant.

